<SCENARIO VER="105">
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\ザッハ中.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<TXSPN>"<STYLE ID="1">Senpai's father</STYLE>'s killer... I want to find them."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花腕組み.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">"Hey now... I get how you feel, but..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"The <STYLE ID="3">Senpai</STYLE> I love so much is suffering. I want to help her, even just a little."<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">"............ Okay. If </STYLE>Goto<STYLE ID="2">'s gonna go that far, I've got no choice. I'll help!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Thank you!
{PAUSE ""}
　That's so reassuring."<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "SE\sceneswitch2.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{PLAYSND "SE\アスファルトダッシュ.ogg" "VOICE2" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\道1夜ブラー.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{DELETECG "人物1" "33" "300" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="4">I let go of my flat-tired bike and ran for the police station as fast as I could.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">I didn't know how many minutes it would take to get there.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">Gasping for breath, I ran as far as I could run.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{STOPSND "VOICE2" "500" "PASS"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\道1夜.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
"Hah! Hah!"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">I put my hands on my knees and stopped.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "SE\棒を振る.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{WAITPLAY "VOICE" "CLICK"}
{STOPSND "SE" "0" "PASS"}
{PLAYSND "SE\tackle1.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{QUAKE "000" "QUAKE" "1" "15" "15" "500" "30"}
{PLAYSND "SE\down1.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\道1夜倒れる.gal" "NORMAL" "14" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="4">What happened...?</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\死神横倒し.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "T" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "111" "グラフィック\背景\手直し・追加\脳挫滅.lcm" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "100" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="4">Am I going to die in a place like this...?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">Senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">, get out of this town, quickly...</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\掲示板.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{DELETECG "111,人物1" "14" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="5">Shiyo 800, April 8　23:50　Anonymous</STYLE><BR>
<STYLE ID="5">hey now, word is there's been another murder!</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="5">Shiyo 800, April 9　0:05　Anonymous</STYLE><BR>
<STYLE ID="5">erina goto (15)</STYLE><BR>
<STYLE ID="5">cause of death: crushed brain from a heavy blow to the head, they say</STYLE><BR>
<STYLE ID="5">crushed brain means the head got all smashed up, huh</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "000" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{STOPSND "BGM" "0" "PASS"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
The Erina Goto<STYLE ID="4"> beating case―</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">Shaking Motoki-cho and then all of Japan, the April 8 Motoki-cho case.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">But it was only the trigger for a still greater tragedy that would come 4 years later.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="4">There was a woman whose heart was deeply wounded by this case.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">It is she who is the protagonist of this tragedy.</STYLE>
{WAIT "100" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
